// Title: Suspicious Parent Double Extension File Execution
// Rule ID: 5e6a80c8-2d45-4633-9ef4-fa2671a39c5c
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1036.007
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
